"Which picture shows a magnetic hard disk drive?\n" +
"IMG: HDD2 | Open metal case showing a shiny round platter with an arm over it\n" +
"IMG: OD2 | Silver box with a tray sliding out holding a disc\n" +
"IMG: RAM1 | Long thin green board with a row of black chips and gold contacts\n" +
"IMG: SSD2 | Flat silver case with a blue label\n" +
"\n" +

// Q7  (Random access memory: correct = RAM4)
"Which picture shows random access memory (RAM)?\n" +
"IMG: RAM4 | Long thin green board with black chips, seen from one end\n" +
"IMG: HDD4 | Black case with a shiny round platter and an arm over it\n" +
"IMG: SSD1 | Metal cover lifted off a small board covered in chips\n" +
"IMG: ROM2 | Two small black chips with rows of metal legs\n" +
"\n" +

// Q8  (Optical disk drive: correct = OD3)
"Which picture shows an optical disk drive?\n" +
"IMG: OD3 | Box with a tray sliding out holding a DVD-R disc\n" +
